-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">3. リゾートホテル海辺の果樹園（香南市夜須町）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.08</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/13721/13721.jpg\" alt=\"リゾートホテル海辺の果樹園 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜太平洋パノラマと果樹園！屋内外プールと新鮮な黒潮海鮮ディナー〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">ファミリー、子連れ、カップル。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「海を望む南国リゾートでプールと高知の海の幸を楽しむならここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F13721%2F13721.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】リゾートホテル海辺の果樹園 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">4. 馬路温泉（安芸郡馬路村）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.38</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/149487/149487.jpg\" alt=\"馬路温泉 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜ゆずと森林鉄道の村！安田川の清流を望む天然温泉とアットホームな宿〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">自然派、一人旅、温泉通。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「緑豊かな馬路村で清流温泉と名物のゆずポン酢料理を味わうならここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F149487%2F149487.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noop